# op::stor
# ========
# Persists the clean master (vaulted offline/encrypted), protected release master,
# compiled .copyright.json manifest, and .ots blockchain proof across storage tiers.

stor(bundle, proofs) -> storage_receipts:
  - stor.0 (local/cold archive) : Clean master WAV + stems + secret CDMA key + .ots
  - public distribution         : Protected master WAV (cloaked + watermarked) + public manifest
